{
  "_comment": [
    "HAND-REVIEWED MINIMAL-PERMISSION POLICY. This is the only _data file that is NOT derived",
    "from upstream. generate-nlm-contract.mjs canonicalizes, validates and hashes it; it never",
    "generates or widens it. Widening is therefore always a reviewed diff to this file.",
    "",
    "This is what the bridge advertises to a host in tools/list. It is deliberately much",
    "narrower than what notebooklm-mcp-cli 0.8.7 accepts. Measured against the real 0.8.7:",
    "  - studio_create.source_ids is OPTIONAL upstream and documented 'default: all sources',",
    "    so an omitted value silently widens the blast radius to every source in the notebook.",
    "    Here it is required, 1-3 items, unique.",
    "  - studio_create.confirm defaults to false upstream; here it must be literal true.",
    "  - notebook_create.title is OPTIONAL upstream; here it is required.",
    "  - source_add accepts url/urls/text/document_id/doc_type upstream; here source_type is",
    "    const 'file' and only file_path is carried, so no network-fetch or paste path exists.",
    "  - source_add.wait defaults to false upstream; here it must be literal true.",
    "  - studio_status exposes action=rename/list_types plus artifact_id/new_title upstream;",
    "    here the field is not accepted at all and the bridge injects action='status'.",
    "",
    "SCHEMA SHAPE NOTE (studio_create): the four artifact branches are modelled as oneOf over",
    "four CLOSED objects, each with additionalProperties:false, rather than one top-level",
    "closed object. A top-level additionalProperties:false cannot see properties declared",
    "inside oneOf branches, so that spelling would reject every valid payload. Closing each",
    "branch instead is what makes mind_map reject focus_prompt/language: those keys simply are",
    "not in that branch, so additionalProperties:false refuses them. artifact_type is a const",
    "per branch, so exactly one branch can ever match and there is no unclosed path in.",
    "",
    "The bridge enforces these rules with per-tool hand-written adapters, not a generic",
    "JSON-Schema engine; this document is the reviewed statement of that policy and the",
    "advertised contract, and its SHA-256 is bound into the Gate A/B fingerprint."
  ],
  "format": "learn-kit-nlm-bridge/public-tools",
  "format_version": 1,
  "policy_version": "v1",
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "notebook_list",
      "description": "List the NotebookLM notebooks available to the signed-in personal account. Takes no arguments.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {},
        "required": []
      },
      "upstream": {
        "tool": "notebook_list",
        "inject": {
          "max_results": 100
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "notebook_get",
      "description": "Get one notebook's metadata and its current source list.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "notebook_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 128,
            "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$",
            "description": "Notebook identifier."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "notebook_id"
        ]
      },
      "upstream": {
        "tool": "notebook_get",
        "inject": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "notebook_create",
      "description": "Create a new, empty notebook with the given title.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 200,
            "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$",
            "description": "Title for the new notebook."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "title"
        ]
      },
      "upstream": {
        "tool": "notebook_create",
        "inject": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "source_add",
      "description": "Upload one local Markdown file, already staged by the skill's hash helper, as a notebook source and wait for processing to finish.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "notebook_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 128,
            "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$",
            "description": "Notebook identifier."
          },
          "source_type": {
            "const": "file",
            "description": "Always the literal 'file'. URL, pasted-text and Drive sources are not available through this bridge."
          },
          "file_path": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 4096,
            "pattern": "^[^\\u0000]*$",
            "description": "Absolute path to a staged .md file inside the helper-owned staging root."
          },
          "wait": {
            "const": true,
            "description": "Always literal true, so the call returns only once processing has finished."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "notebook_id",
          "source_type",
          "file_path",
          "wait"
        ]
      },
      "upstream": {
        "tool": "source_add",
        "inject": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "studio_status",
      "description": "List the studio artifacts in a notebook with their status. Read-only: renaming is not available through this bridge.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "notebook_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 128,
            "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$",
            "description": "Notebook identifier."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "notebook_id"
        ]
      },
      "upstream": {
        "tool": "studio_status",
        "inject": {
          "action": "status"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "studio_create",
      "description": "Create exactly one studio artifact from an explicit set of 1-3 sources. One of four shapes: audio, video, slide_deck, or mind_map.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "title": "audio",
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "notebook_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 128,
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$"
              },
              "artifact_type": {
                "const": "audio"
              },
              "source_ids": {
                "type": "array",
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 3,
                "uniqueItems": true,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 128,
                  "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$"
                },
                "description": "Explicit source IDs. Never omitted: upstream treats an absent value as every source in the notebook."
              },
              "confirm": {
                "const": true
              },
              "audio_format": {
                "const": "deep_dive"
              },
              "audio_length": {
                "const": "default"
              },
              "language": {
                "const": "zh-CN"
              },
              "focus_prompt": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 12000,
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000]*$"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "notebook_id",
              "artifact_type",
              "source_ids",
              "confirm",
              "audio_format",
              "audio_length",
              "language",
              "focus_prompt"
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "video",
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "notebook_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 128,
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$"
              },
              "artifact_type": {
                "const": "video"
              },
              "source_ids": {
                "type": "array",
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 3,
                "uniqueItems": true,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 128,
                  "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$"
                },
                "description": "Explicit source IDs. Never omitted: upstream treats an absent value as every source in the notebook."
              },
              "confirm": {
                "const": true
              },
              "video_format": {
                "const": "explainer"
              },
              "visual_style": {
                "const": "auto_select"
              },
              "language": {
                "const": "zh-CN"
              },
              "focus_prompt": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 12000,
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000]*$"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "notebook_id",
              "artifact_type",
              "source_ids",
              "confirm",
              "video_format",
              "visual_style",
              "language",
              "focus_prompt"
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "slide_deck",
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "notebook_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 128,
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$"
              },
              "artifact_type": {
                "const": "slide_deck"
              },
              "source_ids": {
                "type": "array",
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 3,
                "uniqueItems": true,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 128,
                  "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$"
                },
                "description": "Explicit source IDs. Never omitted: upstream treats an absent value as every source in the notebook."
              },
              "confirm": {
                "const": true
              },
              "slide_format": {
                "const": "detailed_deck"
              },
              "slide_length": {
                "const": "default"
              },
              "language": {
                "const": "zh-CN"
              },
              "focus_prompt": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 12000,
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000]*$"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "notebook_id",
              "artifact_type",
              "source_ids",
              "confirm",
              "slide_format",
              "slide_length",
              "language",
              "focus_prompt"
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "mind_map",
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "notebook_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 128,
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$"
              },
              "artifact_type": {
                "const": "mind_map"
              },
              "source_ids": {
                "type": "array",
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 3,
                "uniqueItems": true,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 128,
                  "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$"
                },
                "description": "Explicit source IDs. Never omitted: upstream treats an absent value as every source in the notebook."
              },
              "confirm": {
                "const": true
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 200,
                "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*$",
                "description": "Display name for the saved mind map. v0.8.7 builds the map from the source IDs alone, so focus_prompt and language are not accepted in this branch."
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "notebook_id",
              "artifact_type",
              "source_ids",
              "confirm",
              "title"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "upstream": {
        "tool": "studio_create",
        "inject": {}
      }
    }
  ]
}
